     official affiliation.
   - Naming: start the name with "AstralParty-XingShu" or "XingShu" followed by
     a clear third-party suffix (allowed: "XingShu Community Fork",
     "XingShu (Bugfix Build)"; not allowed: "XingShu Official", "XingShu 2",
     "XingShu Pro", "XingShu++", or anything implying an official sequel/edition).
